Multi stage docker build allows dividing building  of your image into stages



Commands:


ubuntu@ip-172-31-87-248:~projects/flask-app-ecs$docker build -t flask-app-ecs .        #builds image for the app. but the image size is really big. 
So we use the concept of multi stage build.

We make changes in the Dockerfile, check images. After this

ubuntu@ip-172-31-87-248:~projects/flask-app-ecs$docker build -t flask-app-ecs-mini .   #building one stage with big image and another stage with mini/smaller image
ubuntu@ip-172-31-87-248:~projects/flask-app-ecs$docker images                          # check size of flask-app-ecs-mini image
